(3508738, 491089, 53316, '<td valign="top">Would have prefered it without the hand, but still a very awesome image.  I think I only have that criticism because the rest of the elements fit together so beautifully that I''d like to focus on them. That they fit together so nicely is very cool.</td>', 'Would have prefered it without the hand, but still a very awesome image.  I think I only have that criticism because the rest of the elements fit together so beautifully that I''d like to focus on them. That they fit together so nicely is very cool.', '2007-04-02 02:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
