(3508742, 491203, 53316, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!!! I''ve only seen 19 images so far but this seems to me to be the best of those.  Great colors, mood, lighting.. and wonderful title to bring it all together.</td>', 'FANTASTIC!!! I''ve only seen 19 images so far but this seems to me to be the best of those.  Great colors, mood, lighting.. and wonderful title to bring it all together.', '2007-04-02 02:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508743, 489900, 53316, '<td valign="top">We have one of those in our front yard. It was my second challenge <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=296390" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">entry</a>. I think if we''d tried to attach it to a car, it would have fallen apart! I always love those as photo subjects, and I like what you did with it here.  The colors are good and I like the blue in the sky. Would have maybe prefered a different location; I have the feeling that it would have been very difficult if not impossible to get this looking like it wasn''t tilted. Overall though a nice shot.  I think the strongest point is how "slick" and new the car looks - it''s a good match for the rake.</td>', 'We have one of those in our front yard. It was my second challenge entry. I think if we''d tried to attach it to a car, it would have fallen apart! I always love those as photo subjects, and I like what you did with it here.  The colors are good and I like the blue in the sky. Would have maybe prefered a different location; I have the feeling that it would have been very difficult if not impossible to get this looking like it wasn''t tilted. Overall though a nice shot.  I think the strongest point is how "slick" and new the car looks - it''s a good match for the rake.', '2007-04-02 03:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508749, 490431, 55956, '<td valign="top">nice :)</td>', 'nice :)', '2007-04-02 03:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508750, 490812, 53316, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I''m from Richmond, Virginia so I find this an intriguing concept. I like the execution as well, with a nice muted-color background to offset the interestingly tattered flag.</td>', 'Hmmm. I''m from Richmond, Virginia so I find this an intriguing concept. I like the execution as well, with a nice muted-color background to offset the interestingly tattered flag.', '2007-04-02 03:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
