(3508757, 491452, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very interesting title - it made me click on the thumbnail to see what this would be.  I like the image! Although I would have perfered a different color of shirt underneath (it reminds me of denim color), I love the composition and lighting and the tones, and the concept very much.</td>', 'Very interesting title - it made me click on the thumbnail to see what this would be.  I like the image! Although I would have perfered a different color of shirt underneath (it reminds me of denim color), I love the composition and lighting and the tones, and the concept very much.', '2007-04-02 03:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
