(3508763, 491249, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow!! At first I didn''t really think this met the challenge at all.  Then I started thinking about the interesting green all over that one tree and how it contrasted with the others.... And then I realized that everything in the background and foreground has - not biologically maybe, but visually - died, while the one tree that is the subject is alive, vibrant, young.  It used to live in a forest that was young, but it got uprooted and transplanted to this very old "barren wasteland".  That definitely meets the challenge for me. Well done.</td>', 'Wow!! At first I didn''t really think this met the challenge at all.  Then I started thinking about the interesting green all over that one tree and how it contrasted with the others.... And then I realized that everything in the background and foreground has - not biologically maybe, but visually - died, while the one tree that is the subject is alive, vibrant, young.  It used to live in a forest that was young, but it got uprooted and transplanted to this very old "barren wasteland".  That definitely meets the challenge for me. Well done.', '2007-04-02 03:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508765, 491495, 52449, '<td valign="top">You did a great job with this one. Monica??</td>', 'You did a great job with this one. Monica??', '2007-04-02 03:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
