(3513024, 491168, 69102, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I''m not really getting where the anachronism arises, however, unless you are going for sort of a Huck Finn thing. (??) The bridge seems modern and the guy''s clothes seem modern, so I''m not sure what is out of time.</td>', 'Cool shot. I''m not really getting where the anachronism arises, however, unless you are going for sort of a Huck Finn thing. (??) The bridge seems modern and the guy''s clothes seem modern, so I''m not sure what is out of time.', '2007-04-03 02:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
