(3513599, 491495, 45115, '<td valign="top">Monica this is the very best of the challenge! One of your greatest work. The idea is so fitting and the desat process is so matching with the 60s photos! A 10 from me!</td>', 'Monica this is the very best of the challenge! One of your greatest work. The idea is so fitting and the desat process is so matching with the 60s photos! A 10 from me!', '2007-04-03 06:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3513978, 490408, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice fit for the challenge.  The "castle" certainly seems misplaced.  As for the photo, it''s fine overall.  It''s an accurate capture of the scene in a documentary sort of way.  Artistically it doesn''t do very much IMO.  Considering the challenge is using advanced editing rules you may have tried burning in the background and sides some, then dodge the castle a little to make the castle jump out more.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice fit for the challenge.  The "castle" certainly seems misplaced.  As for the photo, it''s fine overall.  It''s an accurate capture of the scene in a documentary sort of way.  Artistically it doesn''t do very much IMO.  Considering the challenge is using advanced editing rules you may have tried burning in the background and sides some, then dodge the castle a little to make the castle jump out more.  Just a thought.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 09:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3513990, 491301, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea.  Execution comes up a tad short IMO.  As long as you''re setting this up why not find a location without the bare trees behind you?  Looks like you have a nice sky to work with - maximize the impact of that.  The flash is a little harsh and too evident with the well light dirt and the glare on the front of the car and shoes.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful idea.  Execution comes up a tad short IMO.  As long as you''re setting this up why not find a location without the bare trees behind you?  Looks like you have a nice sky to work with - maximize the impact of that.  The flash is a little harsh and too evident with the well light dirt and the glare on the front of the car and shoes.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 09:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514002, 491583, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too contrived (setup) IMO and the number of "props" is excessive.  You''re also way too neat (look at those bundled cords!).  :)  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a bit too contrived (setup) IMO and the number of "props" is excessive.  You''re also way too neat (look at those bundled cords!).  :)  Good luck.', '2007-04-03 09:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514014, 491429, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting composition.  I like the placement of the statue in the frame.  Not quite getting the connection to the challenge; is it the statue that is out of place next to this historical building?  On the technical side, the image would improve at least 1 to 2 points in scoring if it was better focused (it''s blurry).  All JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting composition.  I like the placement of the statue in the frame.  Not quite getting the connection to the challenge; is it the statue that is out of place next to this historical building?  On the technical side, the image would improve at least 1 to 2 points in scoring if it was better focused (it''s blurry).  All JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 10:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514064, 491089, 30049, '<td valign="top">Still behind the curve...need an iPod in there.  :)</td>', 'Still behind the curve...need an iPod in there.  :)', '2007-04-03 10:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514075, 491258, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, ok...you get the clever setup award!  :D  Now if you could have made that lamp come on I''d give you bonus points.  :P</td>', 'Ok, ok...you get the clever setup award!  :D  Now if you could have made that lamp come on I''d give you bonus points.  :P', '2007-04-03 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514087, 491631, 30049, '<td valign="top">One is for hunting, the other for communicating - neither one is displayed in a current context for the item (which would make the other seem more out of place).</td>', 'One is for hunting, the other for communicating - neither one is displayed in a current context for the item (which would make the other seem more out of place).', '2007-04-03 10:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514089, 491203, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Thank you...for adding something fun/interesting to look at.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Thank you...for adding something fun/interesting to look at.', '2007-04-03 10:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514120, 491361, 37719, '<td valign="top">Not too fond of the large amount of negative space in this image considering the lack of detail/substance in the rest of the image.  I like how the rail meets the shoreline.  Nothing to indicate the age of the house and if the fence is supposed to be the modern safety portion (??) I don''t see it - fences are hardly modern.  JMHO.</td>', 'Not too fond of the large amount of negative space in this image considering the lack of detail/substance in the rest of the image.  I like how the rail meets the shoreline.  Nothing to indicate the age of the house and if the fence is supposed to be the modern safety portion (??) I don''t see it - fences are hardly modern.  JMHO.', '2007-04-03 10:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514126, 491284, 32767, '<td valign="top">I hope this wins badly. One of the few images that met the Challenge IMO. In fact...I''ll bet this makes the Blue. Good Luck and super well done. 10</td>', 'I hope this wins badly. One of the few images that met the Challenge IMO. In fact...I''ll bet this makes the Blue. Good Luck and super well done. 10', '2007-04-03 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514140, 490333, 37719, '<td valign="top">The skin looks over-processed.  All definition of shape is lost causing the nose to look distorted.  Doesn''t look natural.</td>', 'The skin looks over-processed.  All definition of shape is lost causing the nose to look distorted.  Doesn''t look natural.', '2007-04-03 10:37:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3514302, 491477, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s funnier, the guy''s in skirts, or the roman soldier?  :D  This is a fun image, too bad the background is so cluttered.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s funnier, the guy''s in skirts, or the roman soldier?  :D  This is a fun image, too bad the background is so cluttered.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 11:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514309, 490706, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great way to take advantage of that wonderful sky!  Many times I''ll see a sky develop like that and not have a subject to put with it.  Clever/cute idea.  Good luck.</td>', 'Great way to take advantage of that wonderful sky!  Many times I''ll see a sky develop like that and not have a subject to put with it.  Clever/cute idea.  Good luck.', '2007-04-03 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514320, 491168, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  Love the color tones, but I''m missing the connection to the challenge.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge...hopefully it will be clarified then.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool photo.  Love the color tones, but I''m missing the connection to the challenge.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge...hopefully it will be clarified then.  Good luck.', '2007-04-03 11:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514328, 491527, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  Well done overall.  Did you try taking this with a polarizer to eliminate/reduce the reflections - just to see what it looked like?  I ask because I find myself drawn to the reflection more than RoboDog.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very clever.  Well done overall.  Did you try taking this with a polarizer to eliminate/reduce the reflections - just to see what it looked like?  I ask because I find myself drawn to the reflection more than RoboDog.  Just an observation.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 11:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514368, 491284, 71958, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I would have liked it more if the subjects were a bit sharper. Them being a bit more in focus than the passing crowd would make them stand out even more.  Still one of my favorites in the challenge, nice shot.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I would have liked it more if the subjects were a bit sharper. Them being a bit more in focus than the passing crowd would make them stand out even more.  Still one of my favorites in the challenge, nice shot.', '2007-04-03 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514370, 491446, 68573, '<td valign="top">nice composition. I like the warm colors and the whole setup 7</td>', 'nice composition. I like the warm colors and the whole setup 7', '2007-04-03 11:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514537, 491506, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done. Lighting is fine. You might consider a smaller crop to remove wasted space a little all the way around, but particularly on the left side. That will focus more attention on your main subject and provide them more room in the composition without losing anything significant from the background.</td>', 'Very creative and well done. Lighting is fine. You might consider a smaller crop to remove wasted space a little all the way around, but particularly on the left side. That will focus more attention on your main subject and provide them more room in the composition without losing anything significant from the background.', '2007-04-03 12:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514587, 490238, 74137, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the classic car driving away from the gridlock of the SUV modern.  The Image captures a lost sense of freedom.  I wish the lighting was better and the image sharper.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the classic car driving away from the gridlock of the SUV modern.  The Image captures a lost sense of freedom.  I wish the lighting was better and the image sharper.', '2007-04-03 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514605, 491284, 74137, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  I love that the crowd mostly moves as a collective excepts these two women filled with collor and life.</td>', 'Good photo.  I love that the crowd mostly moves as a collective excepts these two women filled with collor and life.', '2007-04-03 13:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514613, 491401, 74137, '<td valign="top">The airplane that could leading the pack.  Great Image.</td>', 'The airplane that could leading the pack.  Great Image.', '2007-04-03 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514629, 491237, 74137, '<td valign="top">I like the image the only suggestion I would give is would of been better if you didn''t show the antique telephone''s receiver and left the cell phone where it is.  It just one man''s opinion the image is good regardless.</td>', 'I like the image the only suggestion I would give is would of been better if you didn''t show the antique telephone''s receiver and left the cell phone where it is.  It just one man''s opinion the image is good regardless.', '2007-04-03 13:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514656, 490604, 74137, '<td valign="top">The image is too cluttered.  You don''t need all this technology to convey time and place.  I would keep the cordless phone and loose the computer and cell phone.</td>', 'The image is too cluttered.  You don''t need all this technology to convey time and place.  I would keep the cordless phone and loose the computer and cell phone.', '2007-04-03 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514680, 491631, 74137, '<td valign="top">It''s a great concept. Both are seen as tools of survival but only one was an actual necessity.</td>', 'It''s a great concept. Both are seen as tools of survival but only one was an actual necessity.', '2007-04-03 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514693, 491402, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done.  Clever idea.  Desat works perfect in this scenario.  The portrait is right on the mark with the technical details.  Congrats!</td>', 'Wonderfully done.  Clever idea.  Desat works perfect in this scenario.  The portrait is right on the mark with the technical details.  Congrats!', '2007-04-03 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514699, 490812, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet right on the mark for this challenge.  It''s amazing isn''t it, how the Civil War still remains a viable subject 140 years later.  There still seems to be an article or two in our local paper every week, mostly from a historical context (Central Virginia).  The blown out sky is going to wreak havoc on your score.  Good luck.</td>', 'Simple, yet right on the mark for this challenge.  It''s amazing isn''t it, how the Civil War still remains a viable subject 140 years later.  There still seems to be an article or two in our local paper every week, mostly from a historical context (Central Virginia).  The blown out sky is going to wreak havoc on your score.  Good luck.', '2007-04-03 13:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3514710, 490187, 54033, '<td valign="top">This is it something from now in the past not the other way. Nice photo. 10</td>', 'This is it something from now in the past not the other way. Nice photo. 10', '2007-04-03 13:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
