(3515111, 491203, 76218, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the futuristic building in the background and the subject. I love the colors too. I would like to see more contrast in his face, but that is just me, it still is a great shot.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the futuristic building in the background and the subject. I love the colors too. I would like to see more contrast in his face, but that is just me, it still is a great shot.', '2007-04-03 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
