(3518280, 491529, 40580, '<td valign="top">At first, I didn''t get this anachronism.  Them I looked at it more and I now understand the contrast between the modern and old building.  I hope others get this too.<br/> <br/>Now that I look more at it, I really enjoy the contrary colors of blue and yellow.  Oh wait!  I thought the old yellow building was a reflection off the blue building, but it isn''t.  With all the lines, it looks like a refection.<br/> <br/>The more I look at this picture the more I see.  But I don''t think others will get it.  It''s only a picture of a building.  Nothing striking.  I was going to give an average score, but on viewing it more, I''m giving you high marks.<br/> <br/>(wow, I think that''s the longest comment I''ve ever given.)</td>', 'At first, I didn''t get this anachronism.  Them I looked at it more and I now understand the contrast between the modern and old building.  I hope others get this too. Now that I look more at it, I really enjoy the contrary colors of blue and yellow.  Oh wait!  I thought the old yellow building was a reflection off the blue building, but it isn''t.  With all the lines, it looks like a refection. The more I look at this picture the more I see.  But I don''t think others will get it.  It''s only a picture of a building.  Nothing striking.  I was going to give an average score, but on viewing it more, I''m giving you high marks. (wow, I think that''s the longest comment I''ve ever given.)', '2007-04-04 10:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3518283, 490706, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Nothing to improve except for the halo around her head.  Maybe more detail in the shadows too.  I''m giving you high marks.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Nothing to improve except for the halo around her head.  Maybe more detail in the shadows too.  I''m giving you high marks.', '2007-04-04 10:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3518290, 491383, 40580, '<td valign="top">Witty.  I like it.  I don''t like the table it''s on, too distracting, but I does add to the anachronism.  Good luck.</td>', 'Witty.  I like it.  I don''t like the table it''s on, too distracting, but I does add to the anachronism.  Good luck.', '2007-04-04 10:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3518308, 491609, 40580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  It''s great picture.  I enjoy the lines and the framing.  I don''t think it''ll do well.  There''s a bunch of post processing you can do to make the picture better, but it''s far too much to explain here.  I would''ve given you a low score for the cluter, but the clutter in this picture adds to it.<br/> <br/>Maybe just burning the edges to draw your attention to the center.  Also dodging the main house will help draw attention to it.  Maybe that''s all it needs.  Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful.  It''s great picture.  I enjoy the lines and the framing.  I don''t think it''ll do well.  There''s a bunch of post processing you can do to make the picture better, but it''s far too much to explain here.  I would''ve given you a low score for the cluter, but the clutter in this picture adds to it. Maybe just burning the edges to draw your attention to the center.  Also dodging the main house will help draw attention to it.  Maybe that''s all it needs.  Good luck.', '2007-04-04 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
