(3523467, 489900, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice concept - good props.  I think you could have found another angle/composition to really give this impact.  As is, it looks a little snapshot-ish.</td>', 'Nice concept - good props.  I think you could have found another angle/composition to really give this impact.  As is, it looks a little snapshot-ish.', '2007-04-05 19:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
