(3530533, 491401, 3032, '<td valign="top">IMHO the Mustang is the big boy and the others are modern crap. :)<br/>Seriously, if they''d aksed me which one of these I''d like to fly, I''d choose the P51. But perhaps that''s also why my friends have fourcilinder 120bhp+ bikes and I got myself a thumper with 50bhp. :)<br/>Nice capure, having no experience yet with shooting airplanes (apart from some stuff with film 18 years ago) I guess it is hard to find the shutterspeed that freezes the planes at speed but still shows the motion of the propellor?</td>', 'IMHO the Mustang is the big boy and the others are modern crap. :)Seriously, if they''d aksed me which one of these I''d like to fly, I''d choose the P51. But perhaps that''s also why my friends have fourcilinder 120bhp+ bikes and I got myself a thumper with 50bhp. :)Nice capure, having no experience yet with shooting airplanes (apart from some stuff with film 18 years ago) I guess it is hard to find the shutterspeed that freezes the planes at speed but still shows the motion of the propellor?', '2007-04-08 19:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530741, 491203, 61961, '<td valign="top">On first draft, you get "best in show" from me, for the beauty of your photograph and for clearly conveying the challenge theme.  Good luck,</td>', 'On first draft, you get "best in show" from me, for the beauty of your photograph and for clearly conveying the challenge theme.  Good luck,', '2007-04-08 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530742, 491452, 61961, '<td valign="top">Excellent, clearly conveys the theme.  Great location, the gun is just right (subtle, but not obscure).  I love how the gun is lit, too.<br/> <br/>My only quibble (a minor one) is with the right arm sleeve, which somehow blends/disappears and gives his arm a cut-off look.  Anyway, very well done, good luck!</td>', 'Excellent, clearly conveys the theme.  Great location, the gun is just right (subtle, but not obscure).  I love how the gun is lit, too. My only quibble (a minor one) is with the right arm sleeve, which somehow blends/disappears and gives his arm a cut-off look.  Anyway, very well done, good luck!', '2007-04-08 21:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530743, 491284, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wow, really impressive, and absolutely fits the theme.  You desaturated the crowd a bit.  You did a good job (thank God you didn''t go b&amp;w).</td>', 'Wow, really impressive, and absolutely fits the theme.  You desaturated the crowd a bit.  You did a good job (thank God you didn''t go b&w).', '2007-04-08 21:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530744, 491067, 61961, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of an anachronism.  I''m not a fan of sepia-type photos, but you''ve done a good job and the contrast is especially well done.</td>', 'Good demonstration of an anachronism.  I''m not a fan of sepia-type photos, but you''ve done a good job and the contrast is especially well done.', '2007-04-08 21:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530745, 490925, 61961, '<td valign="top">Did you come up with this concept?  It''s extremely creative!</td>', 'Did you come up with this concept?  It''s extremely creative!', '2007-04-08 21:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530746, 491383, 61961, '<td valign="top">Not a thrilling photo, but an extremely clever concept.  Well done.</td>', 'Not a thrilling photo, but an extremely clever concept.  Well done.', '2007-04-08 21:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530748, 491617, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is one example when two objects from different time periods actually works -- maybe because they are not just placed side by side but are integrated into a concept.  For a basically monochromatic image, this is surprisingly attractive.</td>', 'This is one example when two objects from different time periods actually works -- maybe because they are not just placed side by side but are integrated into a concept.  For a basically monochromatic image, this is surprisingly attractive.', '2007-04-08 21:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530749, 491495, 61961, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful.  Forgive me for saying so, but the anachronism is a bit too subtle: except for the barely noticeable Cinzano umbrella in the back, there''s nothing here to indicate contemporary life.</td>', 'Really beautiful.  Forgive me for saying so, but the anachronism is a bit too subtle: except for the barely noticeable Cinzano umbrella in the back, there''s nothing here to indicate contemporary life.', '2007-04-08 21:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530750, 490530, 61961, '<td valign="top">Fits the theme well enough, I think, though to call it a true anachronism might be inaccurate.  My favorite thing in this photo is the hair!  What a riot.</td>', 'Fits the theme well enough, I think, though to call it a true anachronism might be inaccurate.  My favorite thing in this photo is the hair!  What a riot.', '2007-04-08 21:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530751, 491168, 61961, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not a true anachronism, as both man and location seem contemporary to me.  Whatever the meaning, though, this is an interesting photo and conveys a sense of mystery which draws me in.</td>', 'Perhaps not a true anachronism, as both man and location seem contemporary to me.  Whatever the meaning, though, this is an interesting photo and conveys a sense of mystery which draws me in.', '2007-04-08 21:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530754, 491506, 61961, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, although it''s not a true anachronism -- I think the definition of the word was unclear to many people.  If the rider were wearing less modern clothing it might work better.  I like the odd (coincidence?) that the green pump handle matches the green on the horse''s bridle.  You must have put some effort into arranging this photo shoot!</td>', 'Cute idea, although it''s not a true anachronism -- I think the definition of the word was unclear to many people.  If the rider were wearing less modern clothing it might work better.  I like the odd (coincidence?) that the green pump handle matches the green on the horse''s bridle.  You must have put some effort into arranging this photo shoot!', '2007-04-08 21:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530755, 490378, 61961, '<td valign="top">Conceptually a very good answer to the theme.  Technically the overexposed sky is a problem.  Subjectively, I''m not crazy about the sepia tone, color could just as easily convey age (and increase visual interest).</td>', 'Conceptually a very good answer to the theme.  Technically the overexposed sky is a problem.  Subjectively, I''m not crazy about the sepia tone, color could just as easily convey age (and increase visual interest).', '2007-04-08 21:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530756, 491310, 61961, '<td valign="top">Not an anachronism, but a nice photo.  Although conventional wisdom says not to center the image, I think it works here.</td>', 'Not an anachronism, but a nice photo.  Although conventional wisdom says not to center the image, I think it works here.', '2007-04-08 21:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530759, 491258, 61961, '<td valign="top">Out of place, yes, but not an anachronism. :-(  Looks like you put some effort into this!</td>', 'Out of place, yes, but not an anachronism. :-(  Looks like you put some effort into this!', '2007-04-08 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530760, 490601, 61961, '<td valign="top">An interesting find, makes for a good photo.  I like the light on the big tree.  Sorry, not an anachronism.  I think the definition confused a lot of people.</td>', 'An interesting find, makes for a good photo.  I like the light on the big tree.  Sorry, not an anachronism.  I think the definition confused a lot of people.', '2007-04-08 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530761, 491404, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sadly, this does not convey an anachronism.  I think the definition was unclear to many.</td>', 'Sadly, this does not convey an anachronism.  I think the definition was unclear to many.', '2007-04-08 21:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530762, 490237, 61961, '<td valign="top">More like a game of "Which of these things doesn''t belong"; because all of the books are modern printings, I don''t really see an anachronism.  I like your background, and shooting from below is an interesting pov.</td>', 'More like a game of "Which of these things doesn''t belong"; because all of the books are modern printings, I don''t really see an anachronism.  I like your background, and shooting from below is an interesting pov.', '2007-04-08 21:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530763, 491384, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the cut and paste response, but: Conceptually, putting one old and one new object next to each other without any other context does not convey an anachronism very strongly.</td>', 'Sorry for the cut and paste response, but: Conceptually, putting one old and one new object next to each other without any other context does not convey an anachronism very strongly.', '2007-04-08 21:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530765, 491361, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think your concept needs to be clearer visually.  Although it may seem obvious to you, the fact that this house is ancient is known only by your caption.  I also think the modern railing is too subtle to contrast with the scene -- everything seems in its place.</td>', 'I think your concept needs to be clearer visually.  Although it may seem obvious to you, the fact that this house is ancient is known only by your caption.  I also think the modern railing is too subtle to contrast with the scene -- everything seems in its place.', '2007-04-08 21:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530767, 491242, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but it''s unclear what you are expressing.  Is the modern cell phone a contrast with another time period?  If so, what previous era are the model''s clothes meant to represent?  Or does this have something to do with summer clothes / winter clothes (the glove)?</td>', 'Sorry, but it''s unclear what you are expressing.  Is the modern cell phone a contrast with another time period?  If so, what previous era are the model''s clothes meant to represent?  Or does this have something to do with summer clothes / winter clothes (the glove)?', '2007-04-08 21:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530768, 490894, 61961, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the anachronism in this photo is, sorry.</td>', 'I have no idea what the anachronism in this photo is, sorry.', '2007-04-08 21:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530770, 491250, 61961, '<td valign="top">This compares two ideas, but it does not show an anachronism.</td>', 'This compares two ideas, but it does not show an anachronism.', '2007-04-08 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530771, 489622, 61961, '<td valign="top">There is no anachronism here; I think the photo would be more interesting visually if the potted plant wasn''t present.</td>', 'There is no anachronism here; I think the photo would be more interesting visually if the potted plant wasn''t present.', '2007-04-08 21:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530772, 491631, 61961, '<td valign="top">Conceptually, putting one old and one new object next to each other without any other context does not convey an anachronism very strongly.  Technically, the light glare on your cell phone is a problem.</td>', 'Conceptually, putting one old and one new object next to each other without any other context does not convey an anachronism very strongly.  Technically, the light glare on your cell phone is a problem.', '2007-04-08 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530773, 490132, 61961, '<td valign="top">Not really an anachronism.  The light on your figure glares, and it seems out of focus.</td>', 'Not really an anachronism.  The light on your figure glares, and it seems out of focus.', '2007-04-08 21:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530774, 489239, 61961, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the theme; it might also have worked with the same image on an old-fashioned TV.  As long as advanced editing is allowed, why not clone out the "Commemorative" on the newspaper (unless that''s against the rules).</td>', 'Interesting take on the theme; it might also have worked with the same image on an old-fashioned TV.  As long as advanced editing is allowed, why not clone out the "Commemorative" on the newspaper (unless that''s against the rules).', '2007-04-08 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530785, 491446, 73929, '<td valign="top">Great capture on an anachronism! 10 for me!!</td>', 'Great capture on an anachronism! 10 for me!!', '2007-04-08 21:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530787, 491203, 73929, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo!  It really captures an anachronism.  The lighting, the whole mood of this just works!  Great job!  10 for me!</td>', 'This is a great photo!  It really captures an anachronism.  The lighting, the whole mood of this just works!  Great job!  10 for me!', '2007-04-08 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530791, 491044, 73929, '<td valign="top">Great depiction of an anachronism!  Great feel to this photo... 10 for me!</td>', 'Great depiction of an anachronism!  Great feel to this photo... 10 for me!', '2007-04-08 21:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530794, 490925, 73929, '<td valign="top">Wow! Alot of work went into this anachronism!  Great job... 10 for me!</td>', 'Wow! Alot of work went into this anachronism!  Great job... 10 for me!', '2007-04-08 21:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3530995, 491402, 69487, '<td valign="top">Absolute 10, and BTW i want a print!</td>', 'Absolute 10, and BTW i want a print!', '2007-04-08 23:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531088, 491375, 50695, '<td valign="top">nice integration of the disparate elements. 7</td>', 'nice integration of the disparate elements. 7', '2007-04-08 23:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531091, 490275, 50695, '<td valign="top">I smell ribbon. I''ll give you a 10. You can have the Posthumous Yellow Ribbon, just because this shot is so spectacular.</td>', 'I smell ribbon. I''ll give you a 10. You can have the Posthumous Yellow Ribbon, just because this shot is so spectacular.', '2007-04-08 23:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531095, 490925, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great idea. 7</td>', 'Great idea. 7', '2007-04-08 23:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531100, 490810, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fascinating effect, and truly anachronistic. I''ll give this the Posthumous Red Ribbon and a 10.</td>', 'Fascinating effect, and truly anachronistic. I''ll give this the Posthumous Red Ribbon and a 10.', '2007-04-08 23:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531102, 490604, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is funny and I love that reflection. 8</td>', 'This is funny and I love that reflection. 8', '2007-04-08 23:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531107, 491284, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great street photo! This is head and shoulders above what is really a lackluster challenge. 10 and the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.</td>', 'Great street photo! This is head and shoulders above what is really a lackluster challenge. 10 and the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.', '2007-04-08 23:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531110, 491203, 50695, '<td valign="top">Effectively done, even the kitschy dodge &amp; burn on the grass contributes to the anachronistic effect. 9</td>', 'Effectively done, even the kitschy dodge & burn on the grass contributes to the anachronistic effect. 9', '2007-04-08 23:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531112, 490412, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious. 8</td>', 'This is hilarious. 8', '2007-04-08 23:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531114, 491383, 50695, '<td valign="top">This gets a 9 just for fantastic concept. This is soooo funny.</td>', 'This gets a 9 just for fantastic concept. This is soooo funny.', '2007-04-08 23:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531162, 491609, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great capture and great find.  A room with a view...</td>', 'Great capture and great find.  A room with a view...', '2007-04-09 00:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3531168, 490925, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Love it!  I need one of these keyboards.  Does this work with papyrus then?  :D</td>', 'Great idea.  Love it!  I need one of these keyboards.  Does this work with papyrus then?  :D', '2007-04-09 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
