(3565599, 490494, 67697, '<td valign="top">I wanted to comment on this during the challenge but I ran out of time.  When I first saw this, because of your title and the way the guy looks, my initial reaction was "This is soooooooo the 70''s" lol.  I did eventually notice the camera he is holding but was actually drawn in by everything else.  So it would not surprise me if other fairly unobservant people like me did not see the antique camera.  Oh and I DO like the sepia - I think it fits perfectly with the mood of the pic.</td>', 'I wanted to comment on this during the challenge but I ran out of time.  When I first saw this, because of your title and the way the guy looks, my initial reaction was "This is soooooooo the 70''s" lol.  I did eventually notice the camera he is holding but was actually drawn in by everything else.  So it would not surprise me if other fairly unobservant people like me did not see the antique camera.  Oh and I DO like the sepia - I think it fits perfectly with the mood of the pic.', '2007-04-20 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 0),
